This file describes all steps of exection for THM room (Room 404)
Difficulty - Very Easy

Target IP: http://10.113.181.14:8080

Opens up a website with index page with nothing than few header buttons that don't work
and Reserve option which sent you to "error 404 page not found"

I scanned the IP with nmap using
` sudo nmap -T4 -p- -A -oN nmap.txt 10.113.181.14 `

exposed /.git/ repository was found!

I entered this - http://10.113.181.14:8080/.git/
Inside it included some directories. Firstly I decided to download them all and
open everything via vs code. Nothing interesting.

I looked up a bit when I found a tool called git-dumper

Installation via
` pipx install git-dumper `

Run it with
` git-dumper http://10.113.181.14:8080/.git/ recovered `

It creates a folder called recovered
Inside there were files

app.js     -> Nothing interesting
index.html -> Nothing interesting
README.md  -> FLAG CAPTURED
